<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,362.93 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,362.93 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index ended officially at a seventh successive record closing level of 6,362.93 points, up 43.92, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 2.175 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
